    { tag:'Independence', title:'Let it stand apart from MI4L',
      why:'Studio Liebe isn\'t visibly MI4L, on purpose. Forcing the curator\'s look onto it would have cost the warmth that makes it work.' },
    { tag:'Collabs', title:'A collab gets its own identity and a world per night',
      why:'I designed the full Can\'t Stop × Studio Liebe CI myself, and every event got a world of its own. <b>Clearly framed as a collab</b>, so the core brand stays untouched.' },
    { tag:'Production', title:'Owned the print chain end to end',
      why:'Concept through delivery. <b>Most identity systems quietly fall apart between file and wall.</b> This one didn\'t, because I stayed in the loop.' }
